@startuml FAD — Document Ingestion Workflow
!theme plain
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #444444
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #F5F5F5
skinparam ActivityFontSize 12
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFFDE7
skinparam NoteBorderColor #CCBB55

start

:Moderator submits ingestion request\n(file, collection, classification level, tenants);

:FC-01 authenticates request (FC-02);

:FC-03 validates moderator authority\n(role check + active collection grant);

if (Authorised?) then (No)
  :Reject — 403 Forbidden;
  stop
else (Yes)
endif

note right
  Optionally preview document first
  via FC-11 Document Preview — inspect
  extracted metadata and content
  before committing
end note

:User supplies or confirms metadata overrides\n(title, subject, classification, source URI);

:FC-06 parses document\n(text + structure + metadata extraction);

:FC-06 segments content into chunks\n(section boundaries + navigation links);

:FC-06 encodes each chunk\n(dense semantic vector + sparse keyword vector);

:FC-06 stores encoded chunks in Vector Database\n(vectors + metadata + classification attributes);

:System reports ingestion result\n(chunk count, elapsed time);

:FC-18 records audit entry;

:Content immediately available\nfor retrieval by authorised users;

stop
@enduml
